    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Part II: ROLL Flash -- Accelerating RLVR and Agentic Training with Asynchrony
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Lu%2C+H">Han Lu</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Liu%2C+Z">Zichen Liu</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Xiong%2C+S">Shaopan Xiong</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=He%2C+Y">Yancheng He</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Gao%2C+W">Wei Gao</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Wu%2C+Y">Yanan Wu</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Wang%2C+W">Weixun Wang</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Liu%2C+J">Jiashun Liu</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Li%2C+Y">Yang Li</a>, 
      
